        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Reitinger, Wim Wenders, Bruno Ganz, Solveig Dommartin\n- Works: Wings of Desire, Faraway, So Close!\n- Topics: film, sequel, romantic fantasy\n\nFacts:\n- Wings of Desire is a 1987 romantic fantasy film directed by Wim Wenders.\n- In Wings of Desire, one angel portrayed by Bruno Ganz falls in love with a lonely trapeze artist portrayed by Solveig Dommartin.\n- Richard Reitinger later reunited with Wim Wenders to write Faraway, So Close!, the sequel to Wings of Desire.",
